journalCoverage.description:
Lowest blue score the journal can undo exactly (0 = full coverage by construction);
`null` while an imported snapshot's journal-less history is still the only history,
that is, before this process has journaled a block of its own.

registryCovenantId.description:
Which registry this indexer serves. A client pins its own at build time and compares;
an indexer serving a different deployment is unusable to it, and this is the earliest
point that can be known, before any answer has been acted on.
